OL,3,AAfghanistan explosion kills 10 students
OL,4,Aand injures more than 100, official
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 10 students have been killed
OL,8,Fand 110 others have been injured
OL,9,Ffollowing an explosion near a school in
OL,10,FAfghanistan, a spokesperson has told
OL,11,Fthe BBC.
OL,13,FThe incident happened on Saturday
OL,14,Fmorning in the Anderseir area of
OL,15,FAsadabad, the capital of Kunar
OL,16,Fprovince, the spokesperson for the
OL,17,FTaliban government's interior ministry
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
